BEFORE writing any code, you MUST verify that onEntryChange is actually exported by the installed @contentstack/live-preview-utils package in each codeline. Use resolve_package_symbol to check. The contentstack-sdk-init-engineer role is responsible for creating the utility module that exports onEntryChange — coordinate with that work. Do NOT assume the function signature or return type; verify against the installed package.

Key files you own:
