Do NOT edit src/services/contentstack.ts or the live-preview utility module — that is the contentstack-sdk-init-engineer role's responsibility. Do NOT edit any test files.

Follow each codeline's existing React patterns: check whether they use functional components with hooks, class components, or a mix. Match the existing import ordering convention (all three codelines declare @trivago/prettier-plugin-sort-imports). Use TypeScript strictly — all three codelines use TypeScript with @typescript-eslint.

